<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>KAIZEN — Journal</title>
</head>
<body class="app-page">

  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main class="app-main">

    <div class="page-header">
      <div>
        <h1 style="color:var(--gold);">Trading Journal</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">Write honestly. Kaizen learns from everything you record.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-outline">← Dashboard</a>
    </div>

    <!-- NEW SESSION NOTE -->
    <div class="card card-gold" style="margin-bottom:2px;">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h2>New Session Entry</h2>
        <span class="card-badge">Write Freely</span>
      </div>

      <form action="/dashboard/journal" method="POST" class="journal-form">

        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label">Asset Traded</label>
            <input type="text" name="asset" class="form-input"
              placeholder="e.g. BTC/USDT, EUR/USD, GOLD">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label">Timeframe</label>
            <select name="timeframe" class="form-input">
              <option value="1m">1m</option>
              <option value="5m">5m</option>
              <option value="15m">15m</option>
              <option value="1H" selected>1H</option>
              <option value="4H">4H</option>
              <option value="1D">1D</option>
              <option value="1W">1W</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label">Direction</label>
            <select name="direction" class="form-input">
              <option value="Long">Long</option>
              <option value="Short">Short</option>
              <option value="No Trade">No Trade — Analysis Only</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label">Outcome</label>
            <select name="outcome" class="form-input">
              <option value="Win">Win</option>
              <option value="Loss">Loss</option>
              <option value="Breakeven">Breakeven</option>
              <option value="Pending">Pending</option>
              <option value="No Trade">No Trade</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- THE NOTE — Main freeform area -->
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">Session Notes</label>
          <div class="notepad-wrapper">
            <div class="notepad-toolbar">
              <span class="notepad-hint">Write everything — what you saw, what you did, what you felt, what you learned. Be honest.</span>
            </div>
            <textarea
              name="notes"
              class="form-input notepad-textarea"
              placeholder="Example:

Today I was watching EUR/USD on the 1H chart. I identified a clear supply zone at 1.0850 and waited for price to return to it. When price reached the zone I noticed a strong bearish engulfing candle forming.

I entered short at 1.0848 with my stop loss at 1.0870 (22 pips risk) and target at 1.0790 (58 pips, about 2.6R).

What I did well: I waited for confirmation before entering. I did not chase the move. My position size was exactly 1% of my account as per my rules.

What I struggled with: I almost moved my stop loss when price came back up to 1.0855. I felt fear. I kept it in place and price reversed. This is something I need to keep working on.

Lesson: Trusting the setup and not micromanaging the trade is the discipline I am building."
              required
              style="min-height:300px;line-height:1.9;font-size:0.92rem;padding:20px;font-family:inherit;"></textarea>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label">How did you feel during this session?</label>
            <input type="text" name="emotion" class="form-input"
              placeholder="e.g. Calm and focused, Anxious after first loss, Overconfident">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label">Session Score (0-100)</label>
            <input type="number" name="sessionScore"
              class="form-input" min="0" max="100" value="50"
              placeholder="Rate your discipline this session">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">Did you follow ALL your trading rules this session?</label>
          <select name="ruleCompliance" class="form-input">
            <option value="true">Yes — I followed every rule I set for myself</option>
            <option value="false">No — I broke at least one of my rules</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary btn-full">
          Save Session Entry
        </button>

      </form>
    </div>

    <!-- PAST ENTRIES -->
    <div style="margin-top:32px;">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);">Past Sessions</h2>
        <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.65rem;color:var(--ash);letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;">
          <%= typeof journals !== 'undefined' ? journals.length : 0 %> entries
        </span>
      </div>

      <% if (typeof journals !== 'undefined' && journals.length === 0) { %>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="empty-state">
            <p style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:8px;">
              No sessions logged yet.
            </p>
            <p>
              The traders who journal consistently outperform those who don't.
              Write your first entry above.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% } else if (typeof journals !== 'undefined') { %>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;">
          <% journals.forEach(function(journal) { %>
            <div class="journal-entry-card">

              <div class="journal-entry-top">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;">
                  <span class="journal-asset"><%= journal.asset %></span>
                  <span class="journal-tf"><%= journal.timeframe %></span>
                  <span class="journal-tag <%= journal.outcome === 'Win' ? 'tag-win' : journal.outcome === 'Loss' ? 'tag-loss' : '' %>">
                    <%= journal.outcome %>
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;">
                  <span class="journal-score <%= journal.ruleCompliance ? 'score-good' : 'score-bad' %>">
                    <%= journal.sessionScore %>/100
                  </span>
                  <span class="journal-date">
                    <%= new Date(journal.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
                      month: 'short', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric'
                    }) %>
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="journal-entry-body">
                <p><%= journal.notes %></p>
              </div>

              <div class="journal-entry-footer">
                <% if (journal.emotion) { %>
                  <span style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--ash);">
                    Feeling: <em style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-style:normal;"><%= journal.emotion %></em>
                  </span>
                <% } %>
                <% if (journal.ruleCompliance) { %>
                  <span class="compliance-good">Rules Followed</span>
                <% } else { %>
                  <span class="compliance-bad">Rules Violated</span>
                <% } %>
              </div>

            </div>
          <% }); %>
        </div>
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="empty-state">
            <p>Could not load journal entries.</p>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-outline" style="margin-top:16px;display:inline-block;">
              Back to Dashboard
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>

  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
